@DocumentsService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5104

@accessToken = replace-with-access-token

### Download the external-history template
GET {{DocumentsService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/documentos/importaciones/plantilla
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

### Validate an external student history file
POST {{DocumentsService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/documentos/importaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=docsBoundary

--docsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="archivo"; filename="plantilla_historial_externo.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../../../docs/plantillas/plantilla_historial_externo.xlsx
--docsBoundary--

### Confirm an external student history import
POST {{DocumentsService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/documentos/importaciones/confirmar
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=docsBoundary

--docsBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="archivo"; filename="plantilla_historial_externo.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../../../docs/plantillas/plantilla_historial_externo.xlsx
--docsBoundary--
